/* ── NODE_APP ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 * App-domain read/verify services behind swappable controller leaves: shop
 * want/fulfill sealing and verification, market moderation and purchase views,
 * ROM fetch/seed/journal, VCS package manifest/index/attestation/reward,
 * ZNAM/ZSLP asset views, onion identity and service accessors, principal and
 * authz role tables, wallet recovery status.
 * Same warning as NODE_DB: `rom_fetch_download*`, `rom_seed_policy_set_enabled`,
 * `onion_identity_ensure`, `wallet_recovery_run` and `auth_login_verify` are
 * not pure readers. They are recorded because modules built from those TUs
 * really do import them; the leaf-effect gates, not this file, keep them off a
 * swappable leaf. */
